'use strict';

/* ============================ CHARACTERS ============================ */
/* weight   : knockback taken is divided by this (heavier = harder to launch)
 * dmgTaken : damage multiplier
 * airJumps : extra mid-air jumps
 * lightSpd / heavySpd : frame multiplier on startup + ending lag (lower = faster) · endLag : extra multiplier on ending lag only
 * lightDmg / heavyDmg / heavyKb : damage + knockback multipliers
 * range / tall / reach : hitbox length / height multipliers and disjoint offset
 * armor    : heavy attacks absorb hits (no flinch) during startup + active frames
 * elec / chill : Volt's hits extend hit-stun · Rime's hits slow the opponent · freezeHeavy : Rime's smashes encase the target in ice
 * venom    : light hits stack poison (damage over time) · cling : can wall-cling to stage sides (Apex)
 * grav     : gravity multiplier · hover / jet : hold Space in the air to float / fly (frames / fuel) instead of double-jumping
 * quake    : down-smash sends shockwaves · crawl : hold S to crawl with a lower hurtbox · zoner : CPU keeps its distance
 * backstab : damage multiplier when hitting from behind · kinetic : running charges smash power · glitchy : may teleport out of hit-stun
 * parryBonus : extra parry-window frames · counter : every parry fires a counter-strike (Paladin)
 * sweet    : Ronin's blade tip (far 40% of a hitbox) is a sweet spot · ink : attacks leave ink strokes
 * airCombo : Sylph's aerial light attacks can chain like a jab combo · fill : custom body fill colour
 * special.norecover : the CPU won't use Q to recover · special.aiMelee : the CPU uses Q as a close-range attack · special.ranged : as a ranged poke
 * shieldDrain / shieldRegen / shieldDef / shieldBonus : shield durability and size
 * burnout / drift / flagSmash / carSmash : Dino Nuggi — tyre-smoke jabs, a drifting slide kick, flag + F1-car smash attacks
 * multiJab : each jab is a rapid flurry of N hits (Volt, Striker) · rocketSmash : Mecha's smashes fire its boosters (rocket fists)
 * fiery    : Blaze's smash attacks explode on impact · special.turbo / special.flames : fiery exhaust / leaves burning flames
 * sword    : Aegis swings an energy broadsword (longer reach, sword arcs) · stretch : Toxin's limbs stretch (longer reach)
 * cloneDodge : Kage leaves a shadow clone whenever it rolls · grabArmor : Titan can't be flinched while grabbing
 * echoHits : Chronos's hits repeat as a delayed echo · skate : Zephyr glides on near-frictionless skates
 * beat / beatWave : Pulse — attacks started on the beat (every `beat` frames) hit harder · smashes send floor beat-waves
 * spear : Valkyrie's winged spear · magmaTrail : Magma leaves burning lava when running · sunShield : Sol's shield scorches attackers
 * jetFx 'wind' : Gale's flight is wind instead of rocket fire · holo : Drift is a flickering hologram
 * slimeTrail : Venom leaves poison slime · plasmaTrail : Blitz's dashes leave lightning after-images · claws / wallBounce : Fang
 * hammer : Forge's hammer (special 'temper' supercharges heavies) · pierceShield : Specter's blade ignores shields (not parries)
 * rage : Inferno hits harder the more damage he has taken · corrupt : radius of Byte's physics-corruption field
 * stompShake : Titanus's footsteps shake the screen
 * glide : hover glides forward (Strix) · wings : feathered wings drawn · club / multiHeavy : Kuro's kanabo, smashes hit N times
 * crystalReflect : projectiles under this damage bounce off (Bismuth) · guardian : smashes summon a repeating ancestral guardian (Aura)
 * shapeshift : light attacks morph (Helix) · nunchucks : Zealot's prop · fireTrail : dashing leaves embers (Pyre)
 * whip : light-attack reach multiplier (Kryp) · magmaPillars : grounded smashes erupt a pillar ahead (Brimstone)
 * wireframe / platPhase : Matrix renders as wireframe and drops through platforms instantly · bigShield / unbreakable : Vanguard
 * dualBlade : Omega wields a blade in each hand
 * arch     : animation archetype (poses.js): fighter, heavy, brute, float, mage, ninja, knight, brawler, beast, mutant, skater, acrobat, racer
 * mat      : render material (render/shading.js): plastic, metal, gloss, cloth, energy, shadow, stone, ice, slime, fire, digital, spectral, silk, fur, brass
 * stats    : 0..1 values shown in the character select                              */
